ets all the resident's needs, with timetables and actions that can be measured.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0759":{"code":"F-0759","title":"Ensure medication error rates are not 5 percent or greater.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0919":{"code":"F-0919","title":"Make sure that a working call system is available in each resident's  bathroom and bathing area.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0677":{"code":"F-0677","title":"Provide care and assistance to perform activities of daily living for any resident who is unable.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0609":{"code":"F-0609","title":"Timely report suspected abuse, neglect, or theft and report the results of the investigation to proper authorities.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-e0007":{"code":"E-0007","title":"Address patient/client population and determine types of services needed.","category":"Emergency Preparedness Deficiencies","concept":"emergency_preparedness","concept_label":"Emergency preparedness"},"cms-k0222":{"code":"K-0222","title":"Add doors in an exit area that do not require the use of a key from the exit side unless in case of special locking arrangements.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0918":{"code":"K-0918","title":"Have generator or other power source capable of supplying service within 10 seconds.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life 